### criar pagamento no pix
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/pix
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "transaction_amount": 1249.99,
    "description": "vestido prada",
    "paymentMethodId": "pix",
    "email": "test@email.com",
    "identificationType": "CPF",
    "number": "12345678909"
}


### criar pagamento no cartão de crédito
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "transaction_amount": 499.99,
    "cardToken": "3a06399bd7d94d74a1ba013055b7b20e",
    "description": "compras",
    "installments": 1,
    "paymentMethodId": "master",
    "issuer_id": "issuer",
    "payer": {
        "email": "adrianasevero140590@gmail.com",
        "identification": {
            "type": "CPF",
            "number": "38631897876"
        }
    }    
}

### gerar card token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/generate-card-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "card_number": "5300332990122056",
    "expiration_month": 4,
    "expiration_year": 2028,
    "security_code": "254",
    "cardholder_name": "ADRIANA SEVERO SILVA",
    "cardholder_identification": {
        "type": "CPF",
        "number": "38631897876"
    }
}

